{"id":"00221","root":"uni00221_1","name":{"ja":"槇島　あやめ","en":"Makishima Ayame"},"title":{"ja":"【単独潜入】","en":"【Solo Infiltration】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【単独潜入】 槇島　あやめ","en":"【Solo Infiltration】 Makishima Ayame"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":2,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。心願寺紅に長年付き従っている忠実なる従者。将来を嘱望されたエリート対魔忍だったが、ある事件で紅に命を救われたことからその強さと優しさに心酔して自ら志願して紅の従者となる。“風読み”と呼ばれる異能を持つ。これは周囲の風の流れを察知することで驚異的な精度での狙撃を可能にする他、高度な空間把握・状況認識を持つことで予知に近いレベルでの“先読み”ができるようになる。一見柔和なお姉さんと言った雰囲気だが、主である紅を守るためならどのような手段も厭わない苛烈な一面を持つ。現在は主の紅と共に対魔忍本隊を離れ、独自の立場で様々な活動を行っている。","en":"A Taimanin. She is a loyal attendant who has served Shinganji Kurenai for many years. Once a promising elite Taimanin with a bright future, she became enamored with Kurenai's strength and kindness after Kurenai saved her life in a certain incident, and voluntarily became Kurenai's attendant. She possesses the ability called \"Wind Reading.\" By sensing the flow of wind around her, she can snipe with astonishing precision, and her advanced spatial awareness and situational perception allow her to \"read ahead\" at a near-prophetic level. She gives off the aura of a gentle older sister at first glance, but she has a fierce side that will use any means necessary to protect her master, Kurenai. Currently, she and Kurenai have left the main Taimanin forces and operate independently, carrying out various activities from their own position."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"伊東サラ","forms":[{"id":"uni00221_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1138,2276],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[104,208],"def":[131,262],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","270001"]},{"id":"uni00221_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1776,3552],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[143,286],"def":[197,394],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","270001","270002"]},{"id":"uni00221_3","rarity":6,"rarit